From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:43:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: Desktop over VNC quick setting

Plinius: a tile switches the desktop over VNC on and off, through the
user's socket unit of plinius-desktop. It goes on only while the phone
is unlocked; switching off always works and also ends a running session.
The tile tells when a viewer is connected, a long press opens the page in
GNOME Settings. Its strings come from plinius-desktop's translations,
and without that package it stays hidden.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
